    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1066-a3">

                <pb facs="1158" n="1062" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1062"/>

                <p rendition="#center">[Mr. White to His Royal Highness the Prince of Wales, K.
                    G.]</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have just received a telegram from my
                    Government stating that the President of the United States has received the
                    touching message of sympathy which was sent to him by Your Royal Highness and
                    the Princess of Wales.</p>
                <p>The President directs me to express to Your Royal Highnesses in the name of the
                    American people, no less than in his own, his grateful appreciation of your
                    tribute to our nation in respect to the calamity which has befallen us in the
                    loss of the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine.</hi></p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry White.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
